  "id": "apple-pear-sauce",
  "name": "Apple Pear Sauce",
  "subtitle": "A smooth, gently spiced fruit sauce",
  "description": "Tender apples and pears are cooked with vanilla, blended until smooth, finished with cinnamon, and chilled for serving.",
